    ],
    "text": "I, Faiszer Musthapa, the Minister of Provincial Councils, Local Government and Sports do hereby cancel the GazetteNotification No. 2068/25 dated 26.04.2018 by which the registration of the Archery Association (which is the NationalAssociation for Archery) was revoked with effect from 18.05.2018 under Sec. 32 (b) and 33 of the Sports Act No. 25 of 1973and order that re - registration there of be confirmed as National Association.",
